      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Many treatments have been recommended in the management of phantom limb pain. These have not met with widespread enthusiasm. A new therapeutic endeavour utilizes the group of beta sympathetic blocking drugs. Three case histories of patients with phantom limb pain treated with both beta 1-specific and non-specific beta blocking drugs are reported."},
